ng-relaxed">Instead of expanding your tech stack with another SaaS software mimicking human agents, at Lekta we believe that modern technology offers far greater opportunities. Consolidating customer service within your app can save your organization time, effort, and money while granting greater autonomy over your systems.</p></div><div style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield w-6 h-6 text-muted-foreground mb-4"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path></svg><h3 class="heading-card text-foreground mb-3">Unparalleled Customer Experience for Improved Retention</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">With embedded authentication, and removed IVR menus, Lekta goes straight to fixing customer issues. For maximum accuracy, our systems leverage your backend and knowledge base to deliver context-relevant information to the user, and take independent actions on your system for successful resolution.</p></div><div style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trending-up w-6 h-6 text-muted-foreground mb-4"><polyline points="22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17"></polyline><polyline points="16 7 22 7 22 13"></polyline></svg><h3 class="heading-card text-foreground mb-3">Turning CX Into Revenue Engine</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Customer service provides business insights that can be turned into profit if acted on right. Traditional setups frequently miss high-engagement moments and upsell opportunities. Lekta uses AI-driven contextual data analysis to offer proactive troubleshooting and act on high-probability sales opportunities at the moments of highest engagement to maximize conversions.</p></div></div><div class="mt-16 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center space-y-4" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);"><p class="text-foreground text-lg font-semibold leading-relaxed">Transform Your Customer Service from Reactive and Fragmented Cost Burden to Proactive, Contextual, and Seamless.</p><p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Engage your customers when they are already in the app. Anticipate and act on their needs to streamline the conversation. Isn't that far superior to calling them with irrelevant offers when they are at work or at the gym?</p><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap font-sans text-sm font-normal leading-4 ring-offset-background transition-all duration-200 ease-out focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-copy-dark text-copy-light hover:bg-copy-dark/90 hover:scale-[1.02] active:scale-[0.98] shadow-sm hover:shadow-md bg-gradient-to-r from-copy-dark to-[hsl(0,0%,11%)] h-10 px-4 py-2 mt-4 rounded-lg" href="/contact">Talk to sales now</a></div></div></section><section class="py-20 bg-page-dark relative overflow-hidden md:py-[56px]"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-primary/5 via-transparent to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div><div class="container mx-auto px-4 md:px-6 relative z-10"><div class="grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8 lg:gap-6"><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px);"><div class="relative w-[180px] h-[180px] md:w-[200px] md:h-[200px] mb-4"><svg viewBox="0 0 200 200" class="w-full h-full -rotate-90